			"Message": "feat(Mountain): Replace land.playform.cloud with editor.land\n\nReplace land.playform.cloud with editor.land in DNS command allowlists, dns_get_zone_info zone records, dns_resolve resolution checks, certificate test hostnames, asset service registration, and service registry fixtures.\n\nThis updates ForwardAllowList serialization tests, zone origin and DNS record data, service hostname registration in Entry.rs, and all certificate manager and service registry test cases across the Mountain backend.",
